dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.home=Welcome to the §4Dragon Mounts 2 Add-On§r! For help, check out~LINEBREAK~§l§oGet Started§r!~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§1(You can craft this book again using a dragon scale and a book)§r~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Join the §dDragon Mounts§r community!~LINEBREAK~Discord: §8discord.com/invite/Ewm8aTTJ3K§r~LINEBREAK~Bluesky: §8@dragonmounts.bsky.social§r~LINEBREAK~TikTok: §8tiktok.com/@dragonmountsmod§r~LINEBREAK~Instagram: §8instagram.com/dragonmountsmod§r~LINEBREAK~X: §8x.com/dragonmountsmod§r
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_1=You can find many species of §5dragons§r in your world, each with their own colors, powers, and temperaments.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Start by observing them carefully and building trust with food, patience, and gentle handling.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_2=Dragons can be skittish at first and may fly away if you rush them.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Approach slowly, offer food, and let your bond grow before asking for more.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_3=When your dragon is ready, you can craft and equip a saddle.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Use the saddle and interact with your dragon to begin riding.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_4=Once saddled, you can climb on and guide your dragon through the skies.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Watch stamina, fly carefully, and keep an eye on the land below.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_5=Every dragon has unique strengths, food preferences, and behavior.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Learn the needs of your mount and you will become a better keeper.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_2_1=Use your interact key to feed, saddle, and gear up your dragon.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The controls are simple, but a calm rider makes every journey safer.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_2_2=Movement should remain smooth and steady.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Turn gently, keep your balance, and let your dragon carry you with confidence.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_2_3=Interaction matters most when you are close to your mount.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Use your tools carefully, speak calmly, and never rush the bond.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_2_4=When danger approaches, stay alert and keep your distance.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~A calm rider chooses better movement and better timing.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_2_5=Practice often and learn the rhythm of your dragon.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The more you use the controls with patience, the easier every flight becomes.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_1=Training a dragon is a patient process.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Feed it, protect it, and spend time with it so trust can grow over time.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_2=Trust is built slowly, not forced.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Let your dragon approach you first and reward calm behavior.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_3=Feeding can guide habits and reward good behavior.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Offer the right food and your dragon will learn to associate you with safety.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_4=Handling should stay gentle and deliberate.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~A careful keeper makes a dragon feel secure instead of threatened.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_5=Progress comes from steady care and time.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Small victories become strong bonds when you stay patient.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_4_1=Baby dragons need extra care and attention.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Keep them safe, feed them regularly, and give them time to grow strong.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_4_2=Care for young dragons by keeping them warm, sheltered, and close to a safe routine.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~A stable environment helps them settle quickly.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_4_3=Young dragons grow best when they receive food on a regular schedule.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Always watch for signs of hunger or stress.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_4_4=Safety matters more than speed when a hatchling is growing.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Keep dangerous mobs away and make sure your dragon has a calm place to rest.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_4_5=As a baby dragon grows, its strength and confidence will improve.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Patience now leads to a powerful companion later.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_1=Recipes offer the tools, gear, and crafting options you need for progression.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Use them to build armor, weapons, flutes, and other useful items.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_2=Armor for both dragons and players helps keep your journey safer.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Craft protective gear for your mount and for yourself, then prepare for the battles ahead.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_3=Crafting is the heart of progression in this add-on.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Combine materials carefully and you will unlock new options for your journey.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_4=Saddles and mounts make travel far easier.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Prepare the right gear and your dragon will be ready when you are.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_5=As you gather materials and build better gear, your adventure becomes far more capable.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Every recipe brings new freedom and new possibilities.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_6_1=The settings and preferences in this add-on help you tailor the experience.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Adjust the options to match how you like to play.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_6_2=Your experience is shaped by how you play.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Choose the settings that fit your pace, your comfort, and your goals.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_6_3=Visuals can be adjusted to make the world brighter, clearer, and more immersive.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Tweak them until the add-on feels right to you.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_6_4=Audio settings help you hear your surroundings and your dragon more clearly.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Fine-tune them for comfort and atmosphere.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_6_5=Preferences let you shape the add-on around your own style.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The best setup is the one that makes your adventures feel natural.
