dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.home=Welcome to the §4Dragon Mounts 2 Add-On§r! For help, check out~LINEBREAK~§l§oGet Started§r!~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~§1(You can craft this book again using a dragon scale and a book)§r~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Join the §dDragon Mounts§r community!~LINEBREAK~Discord: §8discord.com/invite/Ewm8aTTJ3K§r~LINEBREAK~Bluesky: §8@dragonmounts.bsky.social§r~LINEBREAK~TikTok: §8tiktok.com/@dragonmountsmod§r~LINEBREAK~Instagram: §8instagram.com/dragonmountsmod§r~LINEBREAK~X: §8x.com/dragonmountsmod§r
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_1=You can find many species of §5dragons§r in your world, each with their own colors, powers, and temperaments.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Start by observing them carefully and building trust with food, patience, and gentle handling.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_2=Dragons can be skittish at first and may fly away if you rush them.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Approach slowly, offer food, and let your bond grow before asking for more.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_3=When your dragon is ready, you can craft and equip a saddle.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Use the saddle and interact with your dragon to begin riding.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_4=Once saddled, you can climb on and guide your dragon through the skies.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Watch stamina, fly carefully, and keep an eye on the land below.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_1_5=Every dragon has unique strengths, food preferences, and behavior.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Learn the needs of your mount and you will become a better keeper.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_2_1=Use your interact key to feed, saddle, and gear up your dragon.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~The controls are simple, but a calm rider makes every journey safer.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_3_1=Training a dragon is a patient process.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Feed it, protect it, and spend time with it so trust can grow over time.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_4_1=Baby dragons need extra care and attention.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Keep them safe, feed them regularly, and give them time to grow strong.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_5_1=Recipes offer the tools, gear, and crafting options you need for progression.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Use them to build armor, weapons, flutes, and other useful items.
dragonmounts2:guide_book.text.page_6_1=The settings and preferences in this add-on help you tailor the experience.~LINEBREAK~~LINEBREAK~Adjust the options to match how you like to play.

